                    <article aria-labelledby="page-title">
                         
                         <section class="hero-wrapper hero-wrapper-cols" aria-label="Welcome">
                              <div class="row no-gutters">
                                   <div class="col-lg-5 col-xl-4 order-1 order-lg-0 d-flex align-items-center hero-txt">
                                        <div class="hero-caption">
                                        	<h2 class="text-white">SOAR with the Hawks</h2>

<p class="text-white">Four competitive athletics teams so you can either show off your talent on the field, or cheer in the stands.&nbsp;</p>

                                        </div>
                                   </div>
                                   <div class="col-lg-7 col-xl-8 order-0 order-lg-1 hero-img hero-img-center-center">
                                    	<p><img alt="SGSC Students" src="/content/userfiles/images/SGSC-May2022-63.jpg" /></p>

                                   </div>
                              </div>
                         </section>

                         <section aria-label="Content">
                              <div class="container-fluid mt-5">
                                   <h2>Welcome to South Georgia State College Athletics!</h2>

<p>The South Georgia State College Hawks program is a member of the Georgia Collegiate Athletic Association (GCAA) and the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA).&nbsp; South Georgia State College currently supports four&nbsp;intercollegiate athletic programs: baseball, softball, men&#39;s basketball, and women&#39;s soccer.</p>

<p>We are very proud of our teams and the accomplishments of all student-athletes on and off the field of play.&nbsp; Our ultimate goal is to make South Georgia State College&rsquo;s intercollegiate athletic program the best among comparable institutions by recruiting quality student-athletes who will excel in the classroom and in athletics.&nbsp; Developing the student-athlete as a successful individual is our primary objective. For more information about our sports teams and programs, contact our athletic staff or follow the links on our site.&nbsp; Please take the time to complete the student athlete information form.&nbsp; We encourage you to visit our beautiful campus, tour our athletic facilities, and meet with our admissions staff, faculty, students, and coaches.&nbsp; We look forward to hearing from you.</p>

<p class="mb-5">&nbsp;</p>

